{{!
    @template mod_these/planning

    Soutenances d'une période regroupées par jour : un titre et un tableau par jour. Le titre d'une
    thèse confidentielle est déjà masqué par \mod_these\output\planning::export_for_template() pour
    qui ne connaît pas le sujet.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isempty Aucune soutenance dans la période.
    * emptymessage Message affiché sans soutenance.
    * days Jours : heading, table (contexte de mod_these/table).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "isempty": false,
        "emptymessage": "",
        "days": [{"heading": "Mardi 3 novembre 2026",
            "table": {"tableclass": "generaltable these-planning", "hashead": true,
                "head": [{"text": "Heure", "class": "header c0", "isth": true},
                    {"text": "Étudiant", "class": "header c1 lastcol", "isth": true}],
                "rows": [{"class": "lastrow", "cells": [
                    {"class": "cell c0", "parts": [{"ptext": {"value": "14:00"}, "phtml": false, "pstrong": false,
                        "pstronghtml": false, "pem": false, "pbadge": false, "pspan": false, "plink": false,
                        "pmuted": false, "pbr": false, "pfiles": false, "pstatus": false, "pdetails": false, "pcode": false, "pcheckbox": false}]},
                    {"class": "cell c1 lastcol", "parts": [{"ptext": {"value": "Anne Martin"}, "phtml": false,
                        "pstrong": false, "pstronghtml": false, "pem": false, "pbadge": false, "pspan": false,
                        "plink": false, "pmuted": false, "pbr": false, "pfiles": false, "pstatus": false, "pdetails": false, "pcode": false, "pcheckbox": false}]}
                ]}]
            }
        }]
    }
}}
{{#isempty}}
<div class="alert alert-info">{{emptymessage}}</div>
{{/isempty}}
{{#days}}
<h4 class="mt-4">{{heading}}</h4>
{{#table}}{{> mod_these/table}}{{/table}}
{{/days}}
